    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experienced police officer who goes to an abandoned house upon receiving an anonymous tip at midnight, is unaware that what he thinks is an ordinary task will change his life forever. The moment he steps through the door, reality slowly begins to unravel; Trapped between ominous whispers, objects moving on their own, and terrifying images from the past, the officer will try to both maintain his sanity and solve the mystery of this dark house. As players progress through the tension-filled atmosphere, they will face a new unknown at every corner, struggling to survive on the thin line between logic and the supernatural.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837650/extras/c20e7d4064225494cc89c9e4047deff4.poster.avif?t=1753065729\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837650/extras/c20e7d4064225494cc89c9e4047deff4.webm?t=1753065729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What does this game offer ?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic horror elements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step by step increasing psychological pressure</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but effective gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that will turn you upside down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837650/extras/5ea3608ae0d7417b51333ebaa80707dd.poster.avif?t=1753065729\" me